        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Self-Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m Pancake, a 2020 grad from a coastal uni. My college dream? Making a game that that mattered. By graduation, all I had was nothing but a rough demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, [So Long, My Youth] is here: a photo-based visual novel weaving together memories of college life. Each screenshot is a real photograph, each dialogue line inspired by my lovely friends. Maybe I wasn’t born to make games, but I had to prove this piece of youth mattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[So Long, My Youth]</i> isn’t perfect, but it’s a slice of my heart—hope you find yours in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/61274de5e7ad97d0cf45c55baa9c7cc9.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/61274de5e7ad97d0cf45c55baa9c7cc9.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【🎓 To the ordinary college days we all know】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashy underdog stories—just honest snapshots of uni life: morning basketball with bros, heated classroom debates, fantastic beaches, community internships. Boring to some, unforgettable to us. Because youth has always been a little bit random, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/aeccf64b076e0320e65edfa0334cf6c1.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/aeccf64b076e0320e65edfa0334cf6c1.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【📸 Unique Art: My Youth Photo Album】<br>Over 100 in-game scenes are taken from my original photographs. Behind the simple composition and lighting lies raw emotion—framed to tell a story: black-and-white vignettes (reality) → full-color display (memory) → soft-focus freeze frames (closure).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/34c65b95bdbebfd0af21e358289969f5.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/34c65b95bdbebfd0af21e358289969f5.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【✍️ Prose Like Water: Years of Polishing】<br>The entire script is concise—under 50,000 words—but I obsessed over every line. My goal? To craft prose that’s lean, natural, and as quietly powerful as the sea—words that don’t just tell a story, but leave a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/6f8607a8c07fec5bfdd58cfc58e07294.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/6f8607a8c07fec5bfdd58cfc58e07294.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【✨Youth/Photography/Visual Novel】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call it a photo-novel, a digital memoir, or a &quot;youth diary told in pixels&quot;—heck, call it realism, call it &quot;that indescribable thing&quot;—labels don’t matter. What does? <i>So Long, My Youth</i> is raw, honest, and steeped in the kind of emotions that stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/7e952a6e98a64c310366328b76aa3d6a.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/7e952a6e98a64c310366328b76aa3d6a.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >qq：761420069 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:email：630042336@qq.com\">email：630042336@qq.com</a> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ps：If a DLL is missing, please run the &quot;缺少 dll 请先安装我.exe&quot; in the folder; if a Trojan is detected, please close the antivirus software before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NOTICE:</strong> Dive into our campus visual novel—a lagre text-based adventure! The English version will launch on Steam months after the Chinese release. Thank you for understanding as we perfect the localization!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Self-Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m Pancake, a 2020 grad from a coastal uni. My college dream? Making a game that that mattered. By graduation, all I had was nothing but a rough demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, [So Long, My Youth] is here: a photo-based visual novel weaving together memories of college life. Each screenshot is a real photograph, each dialogue line inspired by my lovely friends. Maybe I wasn’t born to make games, but I had to prove this piece of youth mattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[So Long, My Youth]</i> isn’t perfect, but it’s a slice of my heart—hope you find yours in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/61274de5e7ad97d0cf45c55baa9c7cc9.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/61274de5e7ad97d0cf45c55baa9c7cc9.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【🎓 To the ordinary college days we all know】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashy underdog stories—just honest snapshots of uni life: morning basketball with bros, heated classroom debates, fantastic beaches, community internships. Boring to some, unforgettable to us. Because youth has always been a little bit random, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/aeccf64b076e0320e65edfa0334cf6c1.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/aeccf64b076e0320e65edfa0334cf6c1.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【📸 Unique Art: My Youth Photo Album】<br>Over 100 in-game scenes are taken from my original photographs. Behind the simple composition and lighting lies raw emotion—framed to tell a story: black-and-white vignettes (reality) → full-color display (memory) → soft-focus freeze frames (closure).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/34c65b95bdbebfd0af21e358289969f5.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/34c65b95bdbebfd0af21e358289969f5.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【✍️ Prose Like Water: Years of Polishing】<br>The entire script is concise—under 50,000 words—but I obsessed over every line. My goal? To craft prose that’s lean, natural, and as quietly powerful as the sea—words that don’t just tell a story, but leave a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/6f8607a8c07fec5bfdd58cfc58e07294.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/6f8607a8c07fec5bfdd58cfc58e07294.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【✨Youth/Photography/Visual Novel】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call it a photo-novel, a digital memoir, or a &quot;youth diary told in pixels&quot;—heck, call it realism, call it &quot;that indescribable thing&quot;—labels don’t matter. What does? <i>So Long, My Youth</i> is raw, honest, and steeped in the kind of emotions that stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras/7e952a6e98a64c310366328b76aa3d6a.avif?t=1767754102\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186270/extras_big/7e952a6e98a64c310366328b76aa3d6a.avif?t=1767754102 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >qq：761420069 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:email：630042336@qq.com\">email：630042336@qq.com</a> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ps：If a DLL is missing, please run the &quot;缺少 dll 请先安装我.exe&quot; in the folder; if a Trojan is detected, please close the antivirus software before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NOTICE:</strong> Dive into our campus visual novel—a lagre text-based adventure! The English version will launch on Steam months after the Chinese release. Thank you for understanding as we perfect the localization!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
